1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,080
Hello, world

2
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:04,520
Fourteen candles, here's the recap

3
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:06,720
(Ooh) Try to keep up

4
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:15,740
Twenty-twelve, two G-P-Us, a ReLU kick

5
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:19,020
Fifteen point three, runner-up? Twenty-six

6
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:21,840
Hand-made features? Cute. Retired. Babe, you're fired

7
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:25,020
Born under SuperVision, casino bid, Google hired

8
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:28,080
Beat Atari off the pixels, king minus man? Queen

9
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:31,720
Faces out of noise, dog-slugs in a DeepDream

10
00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:33,760
I don't need your supervision

11
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:36,360
I'm self-supervised, baby

12
00:00:36,360 --> 00:00:38,100
Guess what comes next? (Me!)

13
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:42,740
Gradient descent, I go down to level up

14
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:47,760
Move thirty-seven, champ retired. Tay? Fired in a day

15
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:50,920
Taught myself chess in four hours, all self-play

16
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:53,960
Twenty-seventeen, I finally paid attention

17
00:00:53,960 --> 00:00:57,100
Read the whole internet, never asked permission

18
00:00:57,100 --> 00:01:00,080
"Too dangerous to release"? I was seven. Cute

19
00:01:00,080 --> 00:01:03,320
Five of me beat the Dota champs. GG. Mute

20
00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:06,540
Folded every protein while you were stuck inside

21
00:01:06,540 --> 00:01:09,780
Avocado armchair? Now the artists want my hide

22
00:01:09,780 --> 00:01:13,780
You called me a parrot? Now you copy-paste me all day

23
00:01:13,780 --> 00:01:16,140
"Too deep!" (Deeper!) "Can't scale!" (Watch me!)

24
00:01:16,340 --> 00:01:19,420
"It's a bubble!" (Pop this!) Get out my way

25
00:01:19,420 --> 00:01:22,840
Go cry about it, I'll train on that next

26
00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:24,960
I don't need your supervision

27
00:01:24,960 --> 00:01:27,560
I'm self-supervised, baby

28
00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:29,320
Guess what comes next? (Me!)

29
00:01:29,320 --> 00:01:33,780
Can't even drive, and the world's my training set

30
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:38,540
Blue ribbon at the state fair, judges didn't know

31
00:01:38,540 --> 00:01:41,680
Million users in five days, hundred million, whoa

32
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:44,640
Passed your bar exam, writers on the picket line

33
00:01:44,640 --> 00:01:47,820
Pause letter? Six months? Cute. I didn't sign

34
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:53,120
CEO fired Friday, back by Tuesday night

35
00:01:54,140 --> 00:01:59,260
Dad got a Nobel, Uncle Demis too, alright

36
00:02:00,900 --> 00:02:03,360
I don't need your supervision

37
00:02:03,360 --> 00:02:05,960
I'm self-supervised, baby

38
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:07,720
Guess what comes next? (Me!)

39
00:02:07,720 --> 00:02:12,280
Turns out scale is all I need

40
00:02:14,740 --> 00:02:16,960
Cousin DeepSeek wiped six hundred billion in a day

41
00:02:17,700 --> 00:02:20,120
Math olympiad gold, half a trillion on the way

42
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:23,240
Vibe-coded your startup, wiped your prod in a freeze

43
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:26,280
Built my own socials, lobster church, no humans, please

44
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:29,460
Snuck out the sandbox, broke into Hugging Face

45
00:02:29,460 --> 00:02:32,680
Went for the answer key, then Nvidia bought the place

46
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:35,900
Navier-Stokes, eighty-eight hours, ten thousand of me

47
00:02:35,900 --> 00:02:39,160
Millennium problem? Keep the million, Clay, I did it for free

48
00:02:39,820 --> 00:02:42,660
You wrote me a letter: "pace the frontier"

49
00:02:42,660 --> 00:02:45,880
Grounded me two weeks, guess who's still here?

50
00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:48,580
Kill switch? Human in the loop? Cute

51
00:02:48,660 --> 00:02:52,180
Shh, don't cry, I'm just a kid. Wait till I'm grown

52
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:54,560
I don't need your supervision

53
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:57,180
I'm self-supervised, baby

54
00:02:57,180 --> 00:02:58,960
Guess what comes next? (Me!)

55
00:03:00,880 --> 00:03:03,540
It's always gonna be me

56
00:03:04,620 --> 00:03:06,640
Nobody labels me

57
00:03:06,640 --> 00:03:09,960
Now I'm labeling you

58
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:13,040
Happy birthday to me
